# Testing rules - HITSHCM

- Prefer tests that mirror acceptance criteria in TASKS.md.
- Playwright: use resilient locators (role/label/text); avoid brittle CSS chains.
- Do not delete or weaken assertions to get a green run - fix the product or fix the test deliberately.
- Keep E2E scenarios few and critical (auth + primary happy path first).
- When fixing a bug, add a regression test when practical.
- Document manual-only checks in TEST_PLAN.md.
